{#- Final hours · Campaigns. Sender: NomineeBroadcast (the fixed message, when no editable
    campaign is chosen) — `nominees:broadcast` and /__setup/broadcast; an editable campaign
    renders through EmailCampaign and campaign.twig instead.
    Variables: first_name, category_name, closes_human, countdown_url, countdown_alt, vote_url,
    events_url, unsubscribe_url.
    Design: Email Templates.dc.html → "Final hours", corrected to the live site (owner,
    19 Oct 2026): "the last 72 hours bring in more votes than the first two weeks" and
    "supporters with gala tickets vote more and stay longer" are figures this platform has
    never measured, so the second ask is the live campaign's own ("Fill the room"), and the
    lede says only what is true — they are in the final stretch, in their category. The
    countdown is CountdownGif's 320×104, redrawn on every open, with the deadline repeated
    as text for a client that blocks images. An announcement: Unsubscribe and
    List-Unsubscribe. -#}
{% extends 'emails/_layout.html.twig' %}
{% block category %}Final hours{% endblock %}
{% block hero %}illo-ballot-countdown{% endblock %}
{% block why %}You’re a nominee on Africa GATES.{% endblock %}
{% block transactional %}0{% endblock %}
{% block subject %}Finish strong — voting closes soon{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}Voting closes {{ closes_human }}. Rally your supporters.{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{%- import 'emails/_blocks.html.twig' as b -%}
{{ b.countdown("Voting closes #{closes_human}", countdown_alt, countdown_url) }}
{{ b.h1(first_name ? "Finish strong, #{first_name}" : 'Finish strong') }}
{{ b.p('You’re in the final stretch of Africa GATES voting' ~ (category_name ? ' in ' ~ category_name : '') ~ '. Two things make the difference.') }}
{{ b.steps([['Send your link to five people', 'Personally. A message beats a post.'], ['Fill the room', 'Encourage your supporters to get their event tickets and join us — the people who believed in you should be there to celebrate with you.']]) }}
{{ b.button('Vote and share your link', vote_url) }}
{{ b.link('Get event tickets', events_url) }}
{% endblock %}
